Z||000000||2xsess||11-29-2001||02:13 PM||||Ironically it seems that I have more trouble with my 97 Transport than I do with my Fiero.<P>Anyways, the ABS light keeps coming on and when it comes on the brake lights don't work..except for the third brake light. I took it to a dealer and they replace the brake light switch and told me that it needs an ABS ECM..to the tune of over $500...of course not covered under the warranty. <BR>My thing is why does the third brake light still work? Anyone have access to a GM shop manual and could scan the schematics of the brake lights for me? OR does anyone have any ideas what I'm to do now?<P>Thanks,<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">           <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||GT-maniac||11-29-2001||03:26 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2xsess:<BR><B>Ironically it seems that I have more trouble with my 97 Transport than I do with my Fiero.<P>Anyways, the ABS light keeps coming on and when it comes on the brake lights don't work..except for the third brake light. I took it to a dealer and they replace the brake light switch and told me that it needs an ABS ECM..to the tune of over $500...of course not covered under the warranty. <BR>My thing is why does the third brake light still work? Anyone have access to a GM shop manual and could scan the schematics of the brake lights for me? OR does anyone have any ideas what I'm to do now?<P>Thanks,<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Don't know if this will help or not but I had a similar problem with my Thunderbird minus the ABS part. I finally traced it to the turn signal switch. Apparently part of the brake circuit ran through there, don't ask why but as soon as I replaced that switch all my brake lights worked again. Fortunately on my car taking the column apart and replacing the switch wasn't that hard.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||2xsess||11-29-2001||10:17 PM||||Thanks for the thought. That's why I really want a schematic for the brake light circuit.<P>Later,<BR>Jeff<BR>||||reg||1
